{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heroine falls into a maze for some strange reason. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will operate the heroine to survive in this maze for 30 days before you have a chance to escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >During the day, you can go into the maze to collect the supplies you need to survive. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you have to get back to the main base before dark! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The maze at night is unpredictable, and there will be scary monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326720/extras/6d47b49d9b52cb6d86487cd7583552fe.poster.avif?t=1760348644\" width=1170 height=657 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326720/extras/6d47b49d9b52cb6d86487cd7583552fe.webm?t=1760348644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the maze, you may experience several different, fairy-tale worlds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many countries in this fairy world, such as the kingdom of playing cards, baboon country, steam country and so on. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nations are at war with each other and the world is on the verge of collapse... </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >As the number of days you live increases, you will be able to travel to every country and discover the secrets hidden in every corner of the world.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326720/extras/2069257358b6b5b46d585eef550feda6.poster.avif?t=1760348644\" width=1170 height=650 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326720/extras/2069257358b6b5b46d585eef550feda6.webm?t=1760348644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326720/extras/2069257358b6b5b46d585eef550feda6.mp4?t=1760348644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to survive, you can build some weapons or defensive towers to ward off monsters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, I recommend building some traps. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Traps cooperate with each other, can form a platoon to contain monsters, causing higher damage. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326720/extras/5b3e562981db5e259169d9baa7da1e3a.poster.avif?t=1760348644\" width=1170 height=642 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326720/extras/5b3e562981db5e259169d9baa7da1e3a.webm?t=1760348644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326720/extras/5b3e562981db5e259169d9baa7da1e3a.mp4?t=1760348644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 2D style, survival and tower defense built survival game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine dungeon and tower defense construction, become a trap master, and punch unexpected Combo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326720/extras/35df84ef52a7d2ee8693ce5678063eb9.poster.avif?t=1760348644\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326720/extras/35df84ef52a7d2ee8693ce5678063eb9.webm?t=1760348644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326720/extras/35df84ef52a7d2ee8693ce5678063eb9.mp4?t=1760348644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3326720?t=1760348644","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3326720?t=1760348644","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326720/056156e5e2f490bdd17ae3947b1c33b704622340/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760348644","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326720/056156e5e2f490bdd17ae3947b1c33b704622340/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760348644","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heroine falls into a maze for some strange reason. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will operate the heroine to survive in this maze for 30 days before you have a chance to escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >During the day, you can go into the maze to collect the supplies you need to survive. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you have to get back to the main base before dark! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The maze at night is unpredictable, and there will be scary monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326720/extras/6d47b49d9b52cb6d86487cd7583552fe.poster.avif?t=1760348644\" width=1170 height=657 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326720/extras/6d47b49d9b52cb6d86487cd7583552fe.webm?t=1760348644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragr